    {
      "text": "uncircumcised … shall be cut off from his people, Gen. 17:14. commit any of these abominations … shall be cut off, Lev. 18:29. not make any cuttings in your flesh, Lev. 19:28 (Deut. 14:1). Lord … shall cut off the nations, Deut. 12:29. cut off the skirt of Saul’s robe, 1 Sam. 24:4. will I cut off Israel out of the land, 1 Kgs. 9:7. when Jezebel cut off the prophets, 1 Kgs. 18:4. cut themselves after their manner, 1 Kgs. 18:28. cut down the groves, 2 Kgs. 18:4. cut them with saws, 1 Chr. 20:3. Lord shall cut off all flattering lips, Ps. 12:3. the wicked shall be cut off, Prov. 2:22. cut off from Babylon the name, Isa. 14:22 (2 Ne. 24:22). all that watch for iniquity are cut off, Isa. 29:20 (2 Ne. 27:31). cut off out of the land of the living, Isa. 53:8 (Jer. 11:19; Mosiah 14:8). cut the calf in twain, Jer. 34:18. ye shall be cut in pieces, Dan. 2:5 (3:29). stone was cut out without hands, Dan. 2:34 (D&C 65:2). shall Messiah be cut off, Dan. 9:26.",
